---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Case Studies | Prodory" description="Prodory case studies are published only after the client approves the write-up and any figures." path="/case-studies/">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-[900px] px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">Case studies</h1>
    <p class="mt-5 text-lg text-[#4B5563]">We publish a case study only after the client has approved the description and every figure in it. None are published yet.</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-[#4B5563]">If you want a reference that matches your situation, ask us in your enquiry and we will tell you what we can share.</p>
    <p class="mt-8"><a class="font-semibold underline" href="/architecture-review/">Book an architecture review</a></p>
  </section>
</Base>
